{"id":"5bf225c28cfeecc6","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-game4-security-strategy.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Security Strategy","display":"df-zfc-game4-security-strategy — ZFC Game4 Security Strategy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-security-strategy","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-security-strategy"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-security-strategy — ZFC Game4 Security Strategy","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-game]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-security-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-security-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-security-strategy — ZFC Game4 Security Strategy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2a48a890cd9aeba0\" href=\"?note=2a48a890cd9aeba0\" title=\"58-df-game\">58-df-game</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0,S_1\\in V\">\\(S_0,S_1\\in V\\)</span> (nonempty strategy-set candidates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\subseteq(S_0\\times S_1)\\times\\mathbb R\">\\(u\\subseteq(S_0\\times S_1)\\times\\mathbb R\\)</span> (bounded payoff-function candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0\\in S_0\">\\(s_0\\in S_0\\)</span> (security strategy candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_0\\in S_0\">\\(t_0\\in S_0\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_1,t_1\\in S_1\">\\(s_1,t_1\\in S_1\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,v\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(a,v\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> (strategy and lower-bound variables)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4SecurityStrategy}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4SecurityStrategy}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}security\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4SecurityStrategy}_S(S_0,S_1,u,s_0)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nS_0\\neq\\varnothing\\land S_1\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,S_0\\times S_1,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall t_0\\in S_0\\;\\forall t_1\\in S_1\\;\\bigl(a\\leq u(\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle)\\leq b\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land s_0\\in S_0\\land\\exists v\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall s_1\\in S_1\\;(v\\leq u(\\langle s_0,s_1\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl((\\forall s_1\\in S_1\\;a\\leq u(\\langle s_0,s_1\\rangle))\\to a\\leq v\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}\\land\\forall t_0\\in S_0\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl((\\forall t_1\\in S_1\\;a\\leq u(\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle))\\to a\\leq v\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}security\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4SecurityStrategy}_S(S_0,S_1,u,s_0)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nS_0\\neq\\varnothing\\land S_1\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,S_0\\times S_1,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall t_0\\in S_0\\;\\forall t_1\\in S_1\\;\\bigl(a\\leq u(\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle)\\leq b\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land s_0\\in S_0\\land\\exists v\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall s_1\\in S_1\\;(v\\leq u(\\langle s_0,s_1\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl((\\forall s_1\\in S_1\\;a\\leq u(\\langle s_0,s_1\\rangle))\\to a\\leq v\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}\\land\\forall t_0\\in S_0\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl((\\forall t_1\\in S_1\\;a\\leq u(\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle))\\to a\\leq v\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The witness <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> is the greatest lower bound of the payoff row for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0\">\\(s_0\\)</span>, and it dominates every lower bound of every other row.  This is the maximin condition without unbound <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\inf\">\\(\\inf\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup\">\\(\\sup\\)</span> terms.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-game","status":"resolved","id":"2a48a890cd9aeba0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-game]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S_0,S_1\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"u\\subseteq(S_0\\times S_1)\\times\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"s_0\\in S_0","display":false},{"tex":"t_0\\in S_0","display":false},{"tex":"s_1,t_1\\in S_1","display":false},{"tex":"a,v\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4SecurityStrategy}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}security\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4SecurityStrategy}_S(S_0,S_1,u,s_0)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nS_0\\neq\\varnothing\\land S_1\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,S_0\\times S_1,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall t_0\\in S_0\\;\\forall t_1\\in S_1\\;\\bigl(a\\leq u(\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle)\\leq b\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land s_0\\in S_0\\land\\exists v\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall s_1\\in S_1\\;(v\\leq u(\\langle s_0,s_1\\rangle))\\\\\n&\\hspace{22mm}\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl((\\forall s_1\\in S_1\\;a\\leq u(\\langle s_0,s_1\\rangle))\\to a\\leq v\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{22mm}\\land\\forall t_0\\in S_0\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl((\\forall t_1\\in S_1\\;a\\leq u(\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle))\\to a\\leq v\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"s_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\inf","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup","display":false}],"bytes":1721,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2211","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-game4-security-strategy.md|58-df-zfc-game4-security-strategy]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","2a48a890cd9aeba0"]}